### 1. Get All Doctors
GET http://localhost:8081/api/doctors

### 2. Get All Patients
GET http://localhost:8081/api/patients

### 3. Book Appointment
POST http://localhost:8081/api/appointments/book?doctorId=1&patientId=1&dateTime=2026-12-01T10:00:00&reason=Checkup

### 4. Get Doctor Appointments
GET http://localhost:8081/api/appointments/doctor/1

### 5. Cancel Appointment (Status Change)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/appointments/1/status?status=CANCELLED